   of fifty percent (50%) or more of the outstanding shares, or (iii) beneficial 
   ownership of such entity, or (iv) the power to elect or appoint a majority 
   of the directors, managers, or governing body of such entity, or (v) any 
   other arrangement whereby an entity directs the affairs of another through 
   contractual rights or operational veto powers regardless of ownership percentage, 
